    "detailed_description": "Welcome to &quot;Papercut Art Gallery,&quot; an artistic puzzle game inspired by the art of papercutting. You'll need to piece together fragments of paper art to restore the museum's growth-themed artworks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-----Game Features------<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 32 growth-themed papercut artworks<br />\r\n- Immersive puzzle experience<br />\r\n- Relaxing background music<br />\r\n- Simple controls<br />\r\n- Moderately challenging levels<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-----Game Controls------<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Left mouse button to move puzzle pieces<br />\r\n- Right mouse button to rotate pieces<br />\r\n- R key to rotate the held puzzle piece<br />\r\n- Esc key to hide or show the game UI<br />\r\n<br />\r\n------------------------",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to &quot;Papercut Art Gallery,&quot; an artistic puzzle game inspired by the art of papercutting. You'll need to piece together fragments of paper art to restore the museum's growth-themed artworks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-----Game Features------<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 32 growth-themed papercut artworks<br />\r\n- Immersive puzzle experience<br />\r\n- Relaxing background music<br />\r\n- Simple controls<br />\r\n- Moderately challenging levels<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-----Game Controls------<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Left mouse button to move puzzle pieces<br />\r\n- Right mouse button to rotate pieces<br />\r\n- R key to rotate the held puzzle piece<br />\r\n- Esc key to hide or show the game UI<br />\r\n<br />\r\n------------------------",
    "short_description": "An artistic puzzle game inspired by the art of papercutting. You'll need to piece together fragments of paper art to restore the museum's growth-themed artworks.",
